# Guard Patrol

entry: opening

SCENE patrol(character)
  loop
    wait until character.spotted_intruder
    -> investigate

SCENE investigate(character)
  approach
    -> examine

  examine
    wait until character.deduction > 60
    -> confront

  confront
    return clue

GENERATOR HarborChorus
  tier:     ambient
  priority: 0.3

  loop
    yield bark from Quiet night. | Stars are out. | Tide's calm.

== opening

The lighthouse hums.
